{"schema_version":"hadith-bank-search-record-v1","id":"zh-muwatta:docx-cf65c0e865be95a7:p002057","language":"zh-CN","source_language_code":"zh-CN","book_key":"malik","edition":"docx-cf65c0e865be95a7","source_id":"zh-muwatta-shaybani-yu-2000-docx","provider_entry_id":"1008","title":"来源编号 1008","text_arabic":null,"text_translation":"伊本·欧麦尔传述：穆圣说：“较之以前的民众，你们的时间犹若晡礼到日落之间。你们与犹太人、基督人的比喻恰似雇佣工人的人说：‘谁为我工作到中午而获得一个基拉特？’结果，犹太人工作了；又说：‘谁为我从午时工作到晡时而获得一个基拉特？’毕兴工作了；又说：‘谁为我从晡时工作到日落而获得两个基拉特？’真的，你们即是从晡时工作到日落而获得两个基拉特的人。”穆圣说：“犹太人与基督人恼怒地说：‘我们工作量大而获得少。’其主人说：‘我克扣了你们的报酬吗？’他们说：‘没有。’他说：‘这属于我的恩惠，我赐予我所意欲的人了。’”","number":{"source_entry_id":"1008","in_book":"1008","canonical":null,"scope":"source_local","numbering_system":"Source-local printed sequence in the Chinese al-Shaybani recension; not canonical Yahya-recension or Sunnah.com numbering","source_sequence_position":1006,"as_printed":"1008、","source_number_status":"explicit"},"narrator":{"name":"伊本·欧麦尔","basis":"Opening attribution as supplied; no full isnad reconstruction."},"source":{"name":"穆宛塔圣训集 — Muwatta of Imam Malik (al-Shaybani recension)","work_title":"穆宛塔圣训集 — Muwatta of Imam Malik (al-Shaybani recension)","url":null,"record_url":null,"original_file":"materials/zh-muwatta-shaybani-yu-2000-docx/穆宛塔圣训集_Muwatta_Chinese.docx","sha256":"cf65c0e865be95a709f228b021e23b94dbc2e3a88d52139330b623a070f5d1b3","record_locator":{"path":"materials/zh-muwatta-shaybani-yu-2000-docx/records.jsonl","line":1006},"format":"docx","original_metadata":{"title":"穆宛塔圣训集 — Muwatta of Imam Malik (al-Shaybani recension)","url":null,"original_filename":"Muwatta_Chinese_Text.docx","metadata_path":"materials/zh-muwatta-shaybani-yu-2000-docx/source-metadata.json","recension":"Muhammad ibn al-Hasan al-Shaybani","work_scope":"Main numbered reports and one identified unnumbered body report across 19 source books; printed numbering gaps preserved. Quotations embedded in excluded commentary are not separately extracted."}},"translator":{"name":"穆萨·余崇仁","name_latin":"Musa